-tagger Test Tagger <tagger@example.local> 1700000000 +0000
-
-tag message
------BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----
-
-inlineline1
-inlineline2
------END PGP SIGNATURE-----
-`,
-			expected: `object 1eca38290a3131d0c90709496a9b2207a872631e
-type commit
-tag v1
-tagger Test Tagger <tagger@example.local> 1700000000 +0000
-
-tag message
-`,
-		},
-		{
